    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cal pa Mika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo jal moro i piny matendere ma Efrayim m'oyido ilwoŋo ni Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owaco ri min ni, “Nusu feza ma romo kilo apar g'adek m'okwal kwoŋin, t'ilamo, aka iluwo kiri m'awinjo, feza no aŋat'akwanyo; nitie bongan.” To min waco ni, “Weyi Rwoth womiy wodan silwany!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go odwoko nusu feza ma romo kilo apar g'adek ri min; to min waco ni, “Adieri aloko maleŋ feza me ri Rwoth wok i cingan ri wodan, ma timo cal m'ogor kodi cal ma nyweny aka onyo pama adwoko rin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo munyo odwoko feza ri min, min okwanyo nusu feza ma romo kilo ario, to miyo jathedhi nyweny, m'otimo gine cal ma nyweny m'ogor; aka obedo i ot pa Mika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika me oyido nitie gi ot pa werin pere, to timo law pa jacway ri Were i wi migam kodi were i cal pa dhano m'ilwoŋo ni terafim, to ketho acel kwoŋ wote, bedo jacway ri were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.21.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jothum 21:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no oyido ongoye kere i Isiraili; kisi dhano oyido timo gim'otire i waŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie jayac moro ma wok Bethelehem i Yuda, janono pa Yuda. Go oyido obedo Jalevi aka bedo kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oay i tindi madwoŋ Bethelehem i Yuda, kadho bedo kama go onwaŋ. Go obino i ot pa Mika i piny matendere ma Efrayim, i woth pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika openjo go ni, “Iwok yukune?” Go odwoko ni, “Abedo Jalevi ma Bethelehem i Yuda, aka awotho rango kamoro je ma bed'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Mika owaco rigo ni, “Bedi kodan, aka lokere ran baba kodi jacway ri were i wi migam, aka alamiyin nusu feza apar kisi oro, kodi nangin kodi gima kwo gine.” To Jalevi no kadho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalevi no oyeyo bedo gi Mika; to jayac no lokere rigo paka acel kwoŋ wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Mika omiyo Jalevi no dwoŋ, to jayac no bedo jacway ri were i wi migam pere, aka obedo i ot pa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika owaco ni, “Pama onyo aŋeyo ni Rwoth latic kodan maber, kole Jalevi otieko bedo jacway ri were i wi migam paran.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
